<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.8"/>
    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Severe aplastic anemia: pancytopenia with a low reticulocyte count, confirmed by a hypocellular bone marrow; attributed to cumulative occupational ionizing radiation; linked to the documented 1934 diagnosis: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Occupational exposure to ionizing radiation over decades of radium research and X-ray work: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Posterior capsule opacification, right eye, after earlier bilateral cataract surgery; glare and blurred reading vision: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Chronic radiodermatitis of the fingertips, with thin, scarred skin: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
