    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Medication: continued without change, Cyclosporine (modified) 100 mg oral capsule, one capsule twice daily, dose adjusted to trough levels by hematology [S]</item><item>Medication: continued without change, Eltrombopag 75 mg oral tablet, two tablets (150 mg) once daily on an empty stomach [S]</item><item>Medication: continued without change, Acyclovir 400 mg oral tablet, one tablet twice daily during immunosuppression [S]</item><item>Goal: Hematology evaluation with bone marrow biopsy within one week of the pancytopenia result. Outcome by 2026-05-18: Seen and biopsied seven days after the first visit [S]</item><item>Goal: No serious infection or bleeding during the first months of treatment. In progress; target 2026-06-29 [S]</item><item>Goal: Early rise in neutrophil and platelet counts by the six-week visit. In progress; target 2026-06-29 [S]</item><item>Goal: Read standard print comfortably with the right eye after capsulotomy. In progress; target 2026-06-29 [S]</item><item>Continue the care plan agreed on 2026-05-11 [S]</item><item>Next visit 2026-06-29: primary care follow-up six weeks into immunosuppressive therapy, after laser capsulotomy of the right eye [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
